{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":33,"alongside":37,"kin":42,"engines":67,"usedOn":68,"sites":69,"crewed":74,"museums":75,"hero":76},null,{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_missions":28,"linked_sites":29,"tagline":13,"description":32},"insight","InSight","lander","NASA","USA","Lockheed Martin","2018-11-26","RETIRED","2011-now","commercial-era","火星の地震計、1300回超の火星地震を検出","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"InSight — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/InSight","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"InSight — NASA Mars","https://mars.nasa.gov/insight/","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"InSight final mission report (NASA)","https://mars.nasa.gov/insight/mission/overview/","deep",[3],[30],{"type":31,"site_id":3},"mars","NASAの2018〜2022年の火星地震計ミッション。1,300回を超える火星地震を検出し、惑星の内部構造を初めて描き出し、大きな溶融した核の存在を確認した。太陽電池パネルに塵が積もり、ついに電力が尽きて終了した。",[34],{"id":3,"name":4,"first":35,"year":36},"火星地震を初めて検出；米西海岸初の惑星間打ち上げ",2018,[38],{"id":39,"name":40,"tagline":41},"atlas-v","Atlas V","United Launch Allianceの進化したAtlas",[43,47,51,55,59,63],{"id":44,"name":45,"tagline":46},"phoenix","Phoenix","マルティアン土壌で水氷を確認",{"id":48,"name":49,"tagline":50},"mars-polar-lander","Mars Polar Lander","1999年の着陸時に喪失。この失敗でNASAは「より速く、より良く、より安く」路線を見直した",{"id":52,"name":53,"tagline":54},"viking-1","Viking 1","火星着陸に初めて成功した着陸機。生物学実験を実施",{"id":56,"name":57,"tagline":58},"viking2-lander","Viking 2 Lander","米国2機目の火星着陸機（ユートピア平原、1976-09-03）。Viking 1着陸機の双子で、1980年まで生物学・土壌化学・気象の観測を実施",{"id":60,"name":61,"tagline":62},"surveyor-3","Surveyor 3","Apollo 12が2.5年後に訪れた",{"id":64,"name":65,"tagline":66},"beresheet","Beresheet","民間初の月面着陸試行",[],[],[70],{"type":31,"href":71,"name":4,"place":72,"text":73},"/mars/insight","エリシウム平原","火星初の専用惑星地震計。1,300以上の火星地震を検出し、2022年5月にマグニチュード4.7の過去最大地震（S1222a）を記録した。熱流プローブ（HP³）は予想外の凝着性を持つレゴリスへの貫入に失敗。2022年12月、太陽電池パネルへのダスト堆積により電力が動作閾値以下に低下し、ミッション終了。",[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/insight/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
